-check h-3 w-3" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>One pillow with each blanket</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[0.95rem] text-charcoal/80"><span class="mt-0.5 grid h-5 w-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-oat text-mocha"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>No extra charge</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[0.95rem] text-charcoal/80"><span class="mt-0.5 grid h-5 w-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-oat text-mocha"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check h-3 w-3" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>No code needed: it’s added to your bag automatically</li></ul><a class="relative inline-flex select-none items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full font-sans font-medium tracking-[0.01em] transition-[background-color,color,border-color,text-decoration-color,transform] duration-300 ease-soft active:scale-[0.985] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border border-charcoal/20 bg-transparent text-charcoal hover:border-charcoal hover:bg-charcoal/[0.03] h-14 px-8 text-[0.98rem] mt-10" href="#shop">Choose your blanket</a></div></div></section>

